【示例 5：追问 + 历史继承】
历史对话：
  用户: 销售额前三的 SKU 是哪些？
  助手: SKU1, SKU2, SKU3
用户查询：这些产品在哪些省份卖得好？
查询改写结果：无
从历史继承的上下文：实体: ["SKU1", "SKU2", "SKU3"]; 维度: ["省份"]
JSON：
{
  "select": [
    {"expr": "dr.province", "alias": "省份"},
    {"expr": "SUM(fo.order_amount)", "alias": "销售额"}
  ],
  "from": "fact_order fo",
  "joins": [
    {"type": "INNER", "table": "dim_product dp", "on": "fo.product_id = dp.product_id"},
    {"type": "INNER", "table": "dim_region dr", "on": "fo.region_id = dr.region_id"}
  ],
  "where": ["dp.sku IN ('SKU1', 'SKU2', 'SKU3')"],
  "group_by": ["dr.province"],
  "order_by": ["销售额 DESC"],
  "limit": null
}

【示例 6：窗口函数 ROW_NUMBER】（2026-09-16 加固）
用户查询：每个地区销售额最高的客户
查询改写结果：无
从历史继承的上下文：无
JSON：
{
  "select": [
    {"expr": "t.region_name", "alias": "地区"},
    {"expr": "t.customer_id", "alias": "客户ID"},
    {"expr": "t.order_amount", "alias": "销售额"}
  ],
  "from": "(SELECT dr.region_name, fo.customer_id, SUM(fo.order_amount) AS order_amount, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY dr.region_name ORDER BY SUM(fo.order_amount) DESC) AS rn FROM fact_order fo JOIN dim_region dr ON fo.region_id = dr.region_id GROUP BY dr.region_name, fo.customer_id) t",
  "joins": [],
  "where": ["t.rn = 1"],
  "group_by": [],
  "order_by": [],
  "limit": null
}
（技巧：ROW_NUMBER 必须包在子查询里,where rn=1 取出每个分区第一名;把子查询整个放 from 字段,用 t 别名）

【示例 7：UNION ALL 合并】（2026-09-16 加固）
用户查询：黄金会员和普通会员的销售额合计
查询改写结果：无
从历史继承的上下文：无
JSON：
{
  "select": [
    {"expr": "'黄金' AS 会员类型"},
    {"expr": "SUM(order_amount)", "alias": "销售额"}
  ],
  "from": "fact_order fo",
  "joins": [
    {"type": "INNER", "table": "dim_customer dc", "on": "fo.customer_id = dc.customer_id"}
  ],
  "where": ["dc.member_level = '黄金'"],
  "group_by": [],
  "order_by": [],
  "limit": null,
  "_union_all": [
    {
      "select": [
        {"expr": "'普通' AS 会员类型"},
        {"expr": "SUM(order_amount)", "alias": "销售额"}
      ],
      "from": "fact_order fo",
      "joins": [{"type": "INNER", "table": "dim_customer dc", "on": "fo.customer_id = dc.customer_id"}],
      "where": ["dc.member_level = '普通'"],
      "group_by": [],
      "order_by": [],
      "limit": null
    }
  ]
}
（技巧：UNION ALL 用 _union_all 数组扩展,每个分支是独立的 select 块;render 时拼成 SELECT ... UNION ALL SELECT ...）

【安全约束】
- 只输出 JSON，不输出任何 SQL 关键字
- 禁止使用 DROP / DELETE / TRUNCATE 等危险模式
- ✅ 允许 UNION ALL(用于多组合并,如"黄金+普通会员分别求和")
- ❌ 禁止 UNION(无 ALL,会去重,本项目业务不需要)
- 字段名必须来自【可用数据表信息】里实际存在的字段，不要编造

